    },
    {
      "text": "Live/work condominium project: each unit to be privately owned under a Condominium Permit. All units are studio or one-bedroom live/work units on floors two through four, 741 to 1,234 SF. Ground floor has a lobby, workshare/co-working space and conference room.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003544"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The 2021 amendment raised the project from a 4-story, 26-unit live/work building with 2,100 SF of retail (approved 2018) to 5 stories and 44 units, removed the retail, and raised height from 53'-8\" to 54'-8\" (55'-0\" maximum). Floor area ratio 2.98 (3.0 maximum).",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003544"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "APR Table A (2020) reports 44 proposed units, owner tenure, all above moderate income.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001132"
      ]
    }
